# This portfolio is a fully static Vite build.
#
# It needs NO environment variables and no server. All content lives in
# src/lib/data.ts, the resume is a static file in public/resume, and the
# GitHub card reads the committed snapshot in src/lib/github-contributions.ts.
#
# Nothing here should be committed with real values. If a form or API key is
# added later, put it in `.env` locally (copy this file) and in
# Vercel → Settings → Environment Variables for the deployment, never in source.
#
# Optional. Only set this when the deployment actually serves a JSON feed of
# GitHub activity (the Cloudflare Worker in sites/worker.js answers /api/github).
# Left unset on Vercel, the site makes no request and uses the snapshot.
# VITE_GITHUB_ENDPOINT=/api/github
